<title>JAPAN: Japan April brass mill output up 2.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan April brass mill output up 2.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's brass mill output rose 2.6 percent in April from the same month a year ago to a seasonally adjusted 100,986 tonnes, according to preliminary data issued by the Japan Brass Makers Association on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The association released preliminary April data for output only. It also released final data for March, as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		 April 1997     yr/yr change    March 1997</p>
<p> Output	  100,986	+2.6 pct	  100,025</p>
<p> Shipments     n/a	     n/a		106,958</p>
<p> Inventories   n/a	     n/a		 35,527</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
